adhur-svare/","title":"Śrī Nāma"},"next":{"path":"/en/kali-ghora-timire-garasala-jagajana/","title":"Kali-ghora Timire"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":133,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"kabe gaura-vane suradhunī-taṭe"},"title":["Siddhi-lālasā"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["kabe gaura-vane    suradhunī-taṭe","    ‘hā rādhe hā kṛṣṇa’ ba’le","kā̐diyā beḍāba    deha-sukha chhāḍi’","    nānā latā-taru-tale"],"translation":["When will I wander, weeping, through the forests of Gaura, on the banks of the Ganges River, crying out “O Rādhā! O Kṛṣṇa!” having given up all bodily comforts, and taking shelter beneath the various trees and creepers?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["śva-pacha-gṛhete    māgiyā khāiba","    piba sarasvatī-jala","puline puline    gaḍāgaḍi diba","    kari’ kṛṣṇa-kolāhala"],"translation":["When, at some outcaste’s home shall I give up all thoughts of caste and beg to share with him humble prasādam and drink the water of the Saraswatī? Along the banks, my voice choked with my ecstasy I’ll chant “Kṛṣṇa” in great delight."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["dhāma-vāsī jane    praṇati kariyā","    māgiba kṛpāra leśa","vaiṣṇava-charaṇa-    reṇu gāya mākhi","    dhari’ avadhūta-veśa"],"translation":["And when will I bow down before a resident of the holy dhām and beg from him a drop of mercy; when O when will I smear my body with dust from a Vaiṣṇava’s holy feet and wear the mendicant’s cloth?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["gauḍa-vraja-vane    bheda nā heriba","    ha-iba varaja-vāsī","dhāmera svarūpa    sphuribe nayane","    ha-iba rādhāra dāsī"],"translation":["Then I shall see no difference between the forest of Gauḍa and Vraja, and I will be transformed into a resident of the dhām. The true nature of the Lord’s abode will manifest itself to my eyes, and I will become a maidservant of Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/46-kabe-gaura-vane","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/kabe-gora-vane","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Siddhi-Lālasā-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/kobe-gaura-vane-suradhuni-tate/","description":"Siddhi-lālasā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Siddhi-lālasā. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"kobe-gaura-vane-suradhuni-tate"}}